      "message": "We could use side-datastructure.\n\n   map: inode -\u003e index\n      {dev,ino} -\u003e 0\n      {dev2, ino2} -\u003e 24\n      {dev3, ino3} -\u003e 48\n\n   index_buffer : 0..MAX_SIZE\n      0:  /data/misc/filename.txt\\0\n      24: /next/file/filename.txt\\0\n      48: /more/misc/filename.txt\\0\n\n   index_max \u003d 72",
